From: BeagleY AI integration <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sensor: add OX03H10 DCC identifier

Identify the BeagleY OX03H10 sensor with its supplied DCC profile.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [BeagleY integration]

--- a/src/tiovx_sensor_module.c
+++ b/src/tiovx_sensor_module.c
@@ -452,6 +452,10 @@ vx_status tiovx_init_sensor(SensorObj *sensorObj, char *objName)
     {
         sensorObj->sensorParams.dccId=728;
     }
+    else if(strcmp(sensorObj->sensor_name, "SENSOR_OX03H10") == 0)
+    {
+        sensorObj->sensorParams.dccId=304;
+    }
    else
     {
         TIOVX_MODULE_ERROR("[SENSOR-MODULE] Invalid sensor name\n");
